# A Federation destroyer on layouts/emitters.jsonc, Venting, starts with its engines and life support destroyed. The
# engines are whole again first: the plasma vent then stops spraying, and its last particles fly on and fade within
# their lifespan, while the steam vent of life support still sprays. The dumps show when the engines are whole.
# Run it with --layout layouts/emitters.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
scroll up 20
wait 4
shot fade-1
dump d1
wait 1
shot fade-2
dump d2
wait 1
shot fade-3
dump d3
wait 1.5
shot fade-4
dump d4
wait 2
shot fade-5
dump d5
